# ---- project-21 dependency check (bin/project-21-check.sh, BH-8079) ----
# Every build sends its tracked lockfiles to project-21 once, after the push, and
# the PR body gets a "Dependency advisories (project-21)" section. Unset = the real
# service, https://project-21.example. Set but EMPTY = not configured: no request, and
# the section says "Check failed (PROJECT_21_BASE_URL is empty: not configured)".
# Every test sandbox sets it empty (tests/lib/scratch.sh). The on/off switch is
# the settings row lib.project-21.project-21_enabled, not this variable.
#PROJECT_21_BASE_URL=https://project-21.example
